  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "難忘ê旅行"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<iframe frameborder=\"0\" height=\"700\" marginheight=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\" src=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vRkPF30BPDUQuomKBgzjTzQXIOjcb1q38IZ3Tdq4A-cfcK5DxfnFQoLvuTqITwbwa0-aK2WX-uIC5Xm/pub?embedded=true\" width=\"700\"></iframe>\n\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b></b></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgu09nNVKFo4IzmwyfjV2oRLPNRhQNc7wNsVEVivu4RxTPX6Oi0_2rhfIr2yqWcX8vnS168nF0XoY0ufObLjRl-eT3t6CDs-awNnmSSfqB9UuhSFlIRL9M9V-PdsmUtnSLzxrT6NOQzYvCEjQ45zRHkeZypujmhaxXMEqBSurDVtgaI3h-PjUZ23M7B1A/s657/%E9%98%BFK%E8%B3%9E%E5%BE%BD%E7%AB%A0_%E9%BB%83%E9%87%91.jpg\" style=\"clear: left; float: left; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"657\" data-original-width=\"457\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgu09nNVKFo4IzmwyfjV2oRLPNRhQNc7wNsVEVivu4RxTPX6Oi0_2rhfIr2yqWcX8vnS168nF0XoY0ufObLjRl-eT3t6CDs-awNnmSSfqB9UuhSFlIRL9M9V-PdsmUtnSLzxrT6NOQzYvCEjQ45zRHkeZypujmhaxXMEqBSurDVtgaI3h-PjUZ23M7B1A/s320/%E9%98%BFK%E8%B3%9E%E5%BE%BD%E7%AB%A0_%E9%BB%83%E9%87%91.jpg\" width=\"223\" /></a></div>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>鄭凱元</b></span></b></span></div><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">今年年初，我有一門必修課叫做「台灣文化概論」，tsit節課理所當然就是ài去認bat台灣ê本土文化、傳統藝術，其中上特別--ê就是教授希望阮逐家ē-sái去參加「大甲媽繞境」ê活動，m̄-nā ē-sái用雙跤tuè媽祖鬥陣行，koh ē-sái深入去了解台灣文化特殊ê所在，甚至是用心去體會台灣人ê人情味，mā kā當做是tńg大人ê儀式。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">起駕儀式ê hit一暗，鎮瀾宮ê廟埕好親像一个大型ê嘉年華會，信眾是e-e陣陣、陣頭mā排kah看bē著尾溜、夜市仔擔ê人tshah-tshah-tshah，啊我ê心情是又koh期待又koh緊張，畢竟beh tuì大甲步lián去到新港，對我來講是一个tsiânn大ê挑戰。但是，阮阿母kā我講：「你就kā當做去tshit-thô，心情放hōo輕鬆，因為tse是真難得ê機會，用錢mā買無。」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">無錯，規欉好好。因為有序大人kap朋友ê陪伴，規tsuā路lóng真平安、真順序，上重要--ê是tī-leh路途中，ē有tsiok濟善心ê人leh pun點心、pun涼水hōo你止飢、止喙ta，koh ē大聲kā你加油，hōo你充滿拚khuì kap khuì力，我感覺就是有tsiah-nī濟溫暖ê支持，我tsiah有法度堅持到底。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Ē記得tī-leh新港ê南崙，我kap一个阿伯拄仔好坐tī涼亭仔leh食早頓，我就好玄問伊為啥mi̍h ē來行大甲媽，伊簡單仔應我講：「啊就為著某囝--lah，所以我用雙跤tuè媽祖行，祈求in健康、平安。」我聽著是tsiok感動，tse mā印證每一个繞境ê香客，lóng有in家己ê故事，tsiânn濟人來參加繞境m̄是為著家己內心ê願望，lóng是為著別人，我也ǹg望家己未來ē-sái有仝款ê疼心，去守護身軀邊ê人。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">大甲媽繞境除了是跤力、體力ê考驗，更加是意志ê磨練。過程中所經歷ê酸甜苦澀，就親像人生ê縮影，也tsiânn做是我上難忘ê旅行，m̄-nā體驗著傳統民俗ê suí，iáu-koh有台灣人ê愛心kap善心。我想，tse就是信仰存在ê意義，伊kā有緣ê人箍做伙，mā kā愛kap溫暖聚集做伙，hōo tsit个社會充滿正面ê態度、希望ê力量。&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><!--more--><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjqGYDj4ldJpuxrCpXKbsjpMCyScX8WUihBVrFXnRDSW_Sob-2I7eFZKqAS8m4TwP94U_N8NvGMLbOdyEEZg_OcNstAjU4AXBhlhA9A3jQauK9B0Lctqq2SRUqWmxDR8z59a6DIbZ61zLxbSMDTvhOZZXex-H_nVJu6Xo9kAZcdh3DjfSSn6x4fHgzwmw/s4032/%E9%84%AD%E5%87%B1%E5%85%83%E5%90%88%E6%88%90.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3024\" data-original-width=\"4032\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjqGYDj4ldJpuxrCpXKbsjpMCyScX8WUihBVrFXnRDSW_Sob-2I7eFZKqAS8m4TwP94U_N8NvGMLbOdyEEZg_OcNstAjU4AXBhlhA9A3jQauK9B0Lctqq2SRUqWmxDR8z59a6DIbZ61zLxbSMDTvhOZZXex-H_nVJu6Xo9kAZcdh3DjfSSn6x4fHgzwmw/w640-h480/%E9%84%AD%E5%87%B1%E5%85%83%E5%90%88%E6%88%90.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">倒手爿--ê是作者鄭凱元</td></tr></tbody></table><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg_vgYrk4hW-sy8lf_5007WQ2siEEHHQ-foS1E7yvfJKkirMC65Z5fzUrVV8MZeP7zzCt4Z9HTCRAvUNg9b8YhdCrfb-DQtLigzgbskNb4RX-s2gWOWqG8Lsg3ZlnKrEgXgXlwx5ec7HJujVca-CSxF1tpZ-JdSCgYyVhWG-vtyNpFz9FIdFS_qIemDTg/s1424/336%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg_vgYrk4hW-sy8lf_5007WQ2siEEHHQ-foS1E7yvfJKkirMC65Z5fzUrVV8MZeP7zzCt4Z9HTCRAvUNg9b8YhdCrfb-DQtLigzgbskNb4RX-s2gWOWqG8Lsg3ZlnKrEgXgXlwx5ec7HJujVca-CSxF1tpZ-JdSCgYyVhWG-vtyNpFz9FIdFS_qIemDTg/w450-h640/336%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiNd6xRQ6sesVrvGglM0l_8Nv5kp9vgfg8RF7UeiyYGU_gZ2UkNCZUm7VX-QA1LEvg2SH1e9DejnYX1NJNJnQH3bmZGV37siOxfMLb1ZPmfltDdMNenSZhruKUt_aN1z_27GPWcwEar8ZWtUtcmTByB9DRCYU4z433KfU8x1f0b5kWZ6CibflrYr6CynA/s4300/%E5%8F